OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum centre could cost #270m,
OL,4,Acampaigners claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners opposing plans for an
OL,7,Fasylum centre at Linton-on-Ouse have
OL,8,Furged a government investigation due to
OL,9,Fclaims it could cost taxpayers #270m.
OL,11,FThe Linton-on-Ouse Action Group has
OL,12,Fwritten to the Chancellor demanding a
OL,13,Ffull financial review before public
OL,14,Fmoney is used to convert the former RAF
OL,15,Fbase on the edge of the village in
OL,16,FNorth Yorkshire.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
