OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum centre could cost #270m,
OL,4,Acampaigners claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group claims the centre could cost
OL,7,Fbetween #443 and #853 per occupied bed
OL,8,Fper night, depending on occupancy
OL,9,Flevels, significantly more than the
OL,10,Fcost of housing asylum seekers in
OL,11,Fhotels.
OL,13,FHowever, the Home Office says its plan
OL,14,Fto close asylum hotels and move people
OL,15,Finto alternative accommodation is
OL,16,Fsaving taxpayers money.
